text: ["({T}: Add {B} or {G}.)\nAs Overgrown Tomb enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {B}.)', "({T}: Add {G} or {W}.)\nAs Temple Garden enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {G}.)', "({T}: Add {R} or {W}.)\nAs Sacred Foundry enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {R}.)', "({T}: Add {U} or {B}.)\nAs Watery Grave enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {U} or {R}.)\nAs Steam Vents enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.\nSurveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nYou gain life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness. Destroy target creature an opponent controls.", "As long as it's your turn, Fresh-Faced Recruit has first strike.", "As long as it's your turn, creatures you control get +1/+0 and have trample.", 'As long as you\'ve surveilled this turn, Darkblade Agent has deathtouch and "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, you draw a card."', 'Beacon Bolt deals damage to target creature equal to the total number of instant and sorcery cards you own in exile and in your graveyard.\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)', 'Boros Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.', 'Chamber Sentry enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.\n{X}, {T}, Remove X +1/+1 counters from Chamber Sentry: It deals X damage to any target.\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Return Chamber Sentry from your graveyard to your hand.', "Choose a card name. Search target opponent's graveyard, hand, and library for up to four cards with that name and exile them. That player shuffles, then draws a card for each card exiled from their hand this way.", 'Choose a creature card with mana value 1 in your graveyard, then do the same for creature cards with mana value 2 and 3. Return those cards to the battlefield.', 'Choose one or both —\n• Deafening Clarion deals 3 damage to each creature.\n• Creatures you control gain lifelink until end of turn.', 'Choose one or both —\n• Exile target artifact.\n• Exile target enchantment.', 'Choose one or both —\n• Tap target creature.\n• Target creature gets -2/-4 until end of turn.', 'Choose one —\n• Destroy target creature with flying.\n• Destroy target enchantment.', 'Command the Storm deals 5 damage to target creature.', "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nChoose one —\n• Create a 2/2 green and white Elf Knight creature token with vigilance.\n• Destroy target artifact or enchantment.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nCreate X 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens with lifelink.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nFlying", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nHexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nIndestructible", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nTarget creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nTrample", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nVigilance", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nWhen Conclave Tribunal enters the battlefield, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls until Conclave Tribunal leaves the battlefield.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nWhen Loxodon Restorer enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nWhen Venerated Loxodon enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature that convoked it.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nWorldsoul Colossus enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.", 'Copy target instant or sorcery spell with mana value 4 or less. You may choose new targets for the copy.', "Cosmotronic Wave deals 1 damage to each creature your opponents control. Creatures your opponents control can't block this turn.", 'Counter target spell with mana value 4 or greater.', 'Counter target spell.\nSurveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)', "Counter target spell. If that spell is countered this way, exile it instead of putting it into its owner's graveyard. You may shuffle up to four target cards from your graveyard into your library.", "Counter target spell. Ionize deals 2 damage to that spell's controller.", "Create a token that's a copy of target creature you control.\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)", 'Create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens with lifelink.', "Creatures you control gain deathtouch until end of turn. Then target creature you control fights target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", "Creatures you control gain indestructible. Take an extra turn after this one. At the beginning of that turn's end step, you lose the game.", 'Creeping Chill deals 3 damage to each opponent and you gain 3 life.\nWhen Creeping Chill is put into your graveyard from your library, you may exile it. If you do, Creeping Chill deals 3 damage to each opponent and you gain 3 life.', 'Deathtouch', 'Deathtouch\nAll creatures able to block Ochran Assassin do so.', 'Defender', "Defender\nAs long as you've cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, Piston-Fist Cyclops can attack as though it didn't have defender.", 'Defender\nWhen Barrier of Bones enters the battlefield, surveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card into your graveyard.)', 'Defender\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Electrostatic Field deals 1 damage to each opponent.', "Defender\nWhenever you surveil, put a +1/+1 counter on Thoughtbound Phantasm.\nAs long as Thoughtbound Phantasm has three or more +1/+1 counters on it, it can attack as though it didn't have defender.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature with defender: Draw a card.", 'Defender, reach\n{4}{G}: Grappling Sundew gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy this creature.)', 'Destroy all creatures with mana value 3 or less.', 'Destroy all creatures with toughness 4 or greater.', 'Destroy target creature with toughness 4 or greater.', 'Destroy target creature.\nSurveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Destroy target creature. You gain life equal to its toughness. You may search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Vraska, Regal Gorgon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle.', 'Destroy target permanent an opponent controls. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Dimir Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Direct Current deals 2 damage to any target.\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)', 'Discard a creature card: Erstwhile Trooper gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', 'Double strike, vigilance, trample', 'Draw a card.\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)', 'Draw two cards.\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)', 'Draw two cards. Then you may discard a nonland card. When you do, Hypothesizzle deals 4 damage to target creature.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+2 and has vigilance.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-2.', 'Enchant land\nWhen Urban Utopia enters the battlefield, draw a card.\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Add one mana of any color."', "Equipped creature gets +1/+0 for each Gate you control and has vigilance and menace. (A creature with menace can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\nEquip {3} ({3}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "Etrata, the Silencer can't be blocked.\nWhenever Etrata deals combat damage to a player, exile target creature that player controls and put a hit counter on that card. That player loses the game if they own three or more exiled cards with hit counters on them. Etrata's owner shuffles Etrata into their library.", "Exile all opponents' graveyards. You may cast spells from among those cards this turn, and mana of any type can be spent to cast them. At the beginning of the next end step, if any of those cards remain exiled, return them to their owners' graveyards.\nExile Mnemonic Betrayal.", 'First strike\nMentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)', "Flash\nFlying\nWhen Dream Eater enters the battlefield, surveil 4. When you do, you may return target nonland permanent an opponent controls to its owner's hand. (To surveil 4, look at the top four cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)", 'Flash\nWhen Whisper Agent enters the battlefield, surveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)', "Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nEnchant creature\nWhen Capture Sphere enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", "Flying\nCrackling Drake's power is equal to the total number of instant and sorcery cards you own in exile and in your graveyard.\nWhen Crackling Drake enters the battlefield, draw a card.", 'Flying\nGatekeeper Gargoyle enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each Gate you control.', "Flying\nMenace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\nWhenever you surveil, put a +1/+1 counter on Dimir Spybug.", "Flying\nMentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, choose up to one target creature you control. Until end of turn, that creature gets +2/+0, gains trample if it's red, and gains vigilance if it's white.", 'Flying\nMentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\nWhen Light of the Legion dies, put a +1/+1 counter on each white creature you control.', 'Flying\nWhen Citywatch Sphinx dies, surveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Flying\nWhen Muse Drake enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'Flying\nWhen Narcomoeba is put into your graveyard from your library, you may put it onto the battlefield.', 'Flying\nWhen Watcher in the Mist enters the battlefield, surveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Flying\nWhenever Hellkite Whelp attacks, it deals 1 damage to target creature defending player controls.', 'Flying\nWhenever Nightveil Sprite attacks, surveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)', 'Flying\nWhenever Roc Charger attacks, target attacking creature without flying gains flying until end of turn.', "Flying\nWhenever Thief of Sanity deals combat damage to a player, look at the top three cards of that player's library, exile one of them face down, then put the rest into their graveyard. You may cast that card for as long as it remains exiled, and mana of any type can be spent to cast that spell.", 'Flying\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Wee Dragonauts gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{1}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Pilfering Imp: Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it. That player discards that card. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'Flying\n{2}{B}, Discard a creature card: Return Kraul Swarm from your graveyard to your hand.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Flying, deathtouch\nHexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'Flying, haste', "Flying, haste\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, if you've cast three or more instant and sorcery spells this turn, return Arclight Phoenix from your graveyard to the battlefield.", 'Flying, lifelink', 'Flying, trample\nPay 2 life: Surveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Flying, vigilance\nMentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)', 'Gain control of target creature with power 2 or less.', 'Garrison Sergeant has double strike as long as you control a Gate.', 'Gateway Plaza enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Gateway Plaza enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you pay {1}.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Golgari Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}.', 'Haste\nMentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)', "Haste\nMentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\nPrevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to other creatures you control.\n{R}{W}: Tajic, Legion's Edge gains first strike until end of turn.", 'Haste\nSacrifice Torch Courier: Another target creature gains haste until end of turn.', 'Haste\nUndergrowth — Golgari Raiders enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each creature card in your graveyard.', "Hexproof\nYou can't cast noncreature spells.\n{2}: Nullhide Ferox loses all abilities until end of turn. Any player may activate this ability.\nIf a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Nullhide Ferox, put it onto the battlefield instead of putting it into your graveyard.", 'If one or more creature tokens would be created under your control, that many 4/4 white Angel creature tokens with flying and vigilance are created instead.', 'If you would draw a card, instead look at the top three cards of your library, then put one into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.\nPay 4 life: Underrealm Lich gains indestructible until end of turn. Tap it.', 'Instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Izzet Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}.', 'Lands you control have "{T}: Add one mana of any color."\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Lava Coil deals 4 damage to target creature. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', "Leapfrog has flying as long as you've cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn.", 'Lifelink', 'Lifelink\nWhen Blood Operative enters the battlefield, you may exile target card from a graveyard.\nWhenever you surveil, if Blood Operative is in your graveyard, you may pay 3 life. If you do, return Blood Operative to your hand.', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)', 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token. That token gains haste until end of turn and attacks this combat if able.', 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\nWhenever Truefire Captain is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to target player.', "Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\nWojek Bodyguard can't attack or block alone.", 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\n{1}{R}: Goblin Banneret gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\n{2}{R}{W}: Boros Challenger gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Other creatures you control get +1/+1.\nWhen Trostani Discordant enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens with lifelink.\nAt the beginning of your end step, each player gains control of all creatures they own.', 'Precision Bolt deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. That creature gains indestructible until end of turn.', 'Reach', "Reach\nUndergrowth — When Kraul Harpooner enters the battlefield, choose up to one target creature you don't control with flying. Kraul Harpooner gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard, then you may have Kraul Harpooner fight that creature.", 'Reach\nUndergrowth — When you cast this spell, reveal the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard. You may put a green permanent card with mana value X or less from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Response deals 5 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', "Return X target creatures of the creature type of your choice to their owner's hand.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand.\nSurveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card into your graveyard.)", "Return target creature to its owner's hand. You may search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Ral, Caller of Storms, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle.", 'Return up to three target multicolored cards from your graveyard to your hand. Exile Vivid Revival.', 'Return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Righteous Blow deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', 'Search your library for a basic Forest or Plains card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to two basic land cards and/or Gate cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Selesnya Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', 'Surveil 2, then choose an instant or sorcery card in your graveyard. You may cast it this turn. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead. (To surveil 2, look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Surveil 2, then draw a card. (To surveil 2, look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Surveil 2, then draw two cards. Notion Rain deals 2 damage to you. (To surveil 2, look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Switch the power and toughness of each of up to two target creatures until end of turn.', "Tap target creature. Sonic Assault deals 2 damage to that creature's controller.\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)", 'Target creature deals damage to itself equal to its power.', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains flying until end of turn.\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains haste until end of turn.\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature you control.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. You gain 1 life for each attacking creature you control.', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.\nTarget creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.\nTarget creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-0 until end of turn.\nSurveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target player.\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)', "Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", "Target opponent may have Risk Factor deal 4 damage to them. If that player doesn't, you draw three cards.\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)", 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it. That player discards that card.\nSurveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)', "Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from that player's graveyard or hand and exile it.", "This spell can't be countered.\nFlying\nWhenever you draw a card, Niv-Mizzet, Parun deals 1 damage to any target.\nWhenever a player casts an instant or sorcery spell, you draw a card.", "This spell can't be countered.\nInescapable Blaze deals 6 damage to any target.", 'This spell costs {2} less to cast if it targets a legendary creature.\nDestroy target creature.\nSurveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Trample\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, exile a creature card from your graveyard. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on Charnel Troll. Otherwise, sacrifice it.\n{B}{G}, Discard a creature card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Charnel Troll.', 'Trample\nRampaging Monument enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\nWhenever you cast a multicolored spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Rampaging Monument.', 'Trample\nWhenever Book Devourer deals combat damage to a player, you may discard all the cards in your hand. If you do, draw that many cards.', "Trample\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Erratic Cyclops gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is that spell's mana value.", 'Trample\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Fire Urchin gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\nWhenever Ral's Staticaster attacks, if you control a Ral planeswalker, Ral's Staticaster gets +1/+0 for each card in your hand until end of turn.", 'Undergrowth — Rhizome Lurcher enters the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.', 'Undergrowth — Search your library for a black card with mana value less than or equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Undergrowth — Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'Undergrowth — This spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature card in your graveyard.\nWhen Molderhulk enters the battlefield, return target land card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Undergrowth — When Izoni, Thousand-Eyed enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 black and green Insect creature token for each creature card in your graveyard.\n{B}{G}, Sacrifice another creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', 'Undergrowth — When Kraul Foragers enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life for each creature card in your graveyard.', 'Undergrowth — When Lotleth Giant enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to target opponent for each creature card in your graveyard.', "Undergrowth — When Moodmark Painter enters the battlefield, target creature gains menace and gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", "Undergrowth — When Vigorspore Wurm enters the battlefield, target creature gains vigilance and gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard.\nVigorspore Wurm can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Untap all creatures you control. They gain hexproof and indestructible until end of turn. (They can\'t be the targets of spells or abilities your opponents control. Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them.)', 'Vicious Rumors deals 1 damage to each opponent. Each opponent discards a card, then mills a card. You gain 1 life.', 'Vigilance', 'Vigilance\nWhen Conclave Cavalier dies, create two 2/2 green and white Elf Knight creature tokens with vigilance.', 'Vigilance\nWhen Intrusive Packbeast enters the battlefield, tap up to two target creatures your opponents control.', 'Vigilance\nWhenever Swathcutter Giant attacks, it deals 1 damage to each creature defending player controls.', "Vigilance\n{T}, Sacrifice Bounty Agent: Destroy target legendary permanent that's an artifact, creature, or enchantment.", "When Affectionate Indrik enters the battlefield, you may have it fight target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", "When Attendant of Vraska dies, if you control a Vraska planeswalker, you gain life equal to Attendant of Vraska's power.", 'When Burglar Rat enters the battlefield, each opponent discards a card.', 'When Centaur Peacemaker enters the battlefield, each player gains 4 life.', 'When Dimir Informant enters the battlefield, surveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', "When Disinformation Campaign enters the battlefield, you draw a card and each opponent discards a card.\nWhenever you surveil, return Disinformation Campaign to its owner's hand.", 'When District Guide enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card or Gate card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Generous Stray enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Glowspore Shaman enters the battlefield, mill three cards. You may put a land card from your graveyard on top of your library. (To mill a card, put the top card of your library into your graveyard.)', 'When Golgari Findbroker enters the battlefield, return target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Guild Summit enters the battlefield, you may tap any number of untapped Gates you control. Draw a card for each Gate tapped this way.\nWhenever a Gate enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.', 'When Hunted Witness dies, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', 'When Ironshell Beetle enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'When Knight of Autumn enters the battlefield, choose one —\n• Put two +1/+1 counters on Knight of Autumn.\n• Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\n• You gain 4 life.', "When Lazav, the Multifarious enters the battlefield, surveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)\n{X}: Lazav, the Multifarious becomes a copy of target creature card in your graveyard with mana value X, except its name is Lazav, the Multifarious, it's legendary in addition to its other types, and it has this ability.", "When Plaguecrafter enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature or planeswalker. Each player who can't discards a card.", 'When Rubblebelt Boar enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'When Spinal Centipede dies, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.', 'When Sumala Woodshaper enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature or enchantment card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'When Tenth District Guard enters the battlefield, target creature gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Emmara, Soul of the Accord becomes tapped, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', "Whenever Goblin Locksmith attacks, creatures with defender can't block this turn.", 'Whenever Haazda Marshal and at least two other creatures attack, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', 'Whenever Inspiring Unicorn attacks, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Ledev Champion attacks, you may tap any number of untapped creatures you control. Ledev Champion gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature tapped this way.\n{3}{G}{W}: Create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', 'Whenever Ornery Goblin blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, Ornery Goblin deals 1 damage to that creature.', 'Whenever Skyline Scout attacks, you may pay {1}{W}. If you do, it gains flying until end of turn.', 'Whenever Vedalken Mesmerist attacks, target creature an opponent controls gets -2/-0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, Midnight Reaper deals 1 damage to you and you draw a card.', "Whenever another creature you control enters the battlefield or dies, if that creature's power is greater than Pelt Collector's, put a +1/+1 counter on Pelt Collector.\nAs long as Pelt Collector has three or more +1/+1 counters on it, it has trample.", 'Whenever you cast a blue spell, target player mills two cards.', 'Whenever you cast a creature spell, draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast a red spell, if Runaway Steam-Kin has fewer than three +1/+1 counters on it, put a +1/+1 counter on Runaway Steam-Kin.\nRemove three +1/+1 counters from Runaway Steam-Kin: Add {R}{R}{R}.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell that targets only Beamsplitter Mage, if you control one or more other creatures that spell could target, choose one of those creatures. Copy that spell. The copy targets the chosen creature.', "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, copy it for each other instant and sorcery spell you've cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.", 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 blue Bird Illusion creature token with flying.', "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, put a charge counter on Firemind's Research.\n{1}{U}, Remove two charge counters from Firemind's Research: Draw a card.\n{1}{R}, Remove five charge counters from Firemind's Research: It deals 5 damage to any target.", "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, target creature an opponent controls can't block this turn.", 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.\n{3}{W}: Create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', 'Whenever you surveil for the first time each turn, Whispering Snitch deals 1 damage to each opponent and you gain 1 life.', 'You gain X life and draw X cards, where X is the number of creatures you control. Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'You may look at an additional two cards each time you surveil.\nExile Enhanced Surveillance: Shuffle your graveyard into your library.', "You may look at the top card of your library any time.\nYou may play lands and cast spells from the top of your library.\nYou can't play lands or cast spells from your hand.\n{3}{R}: Destroy Experimental Frenzy.", '[+1]: Draw a card.\n[−2]: Ral, Caller of Storms deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.\n[−7]: Draw seven cards. Ral, Caller of Storms deals 7 damage to each creature your opponents control.', '[+1]: Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other into your graveyard.\n[−3]: Ral, Izzet Viceroy deals damage to target creature equal to the total number of instant and sorcery cards you own in exile and in your graveyard.\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this emblem deals 4 damage to any target and you draw two cards."', '[+2]: Put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature. That creature gains menace until end of turn.\n[−3]: Destroy target creature.\n[−10]: For each creature card in your graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.', '[+2]: You may sacrifice another permanent. If you do, you gain 1 life and draw a card.\n[−3]: Destroy target nonland permanent with mana value 3 or less.\n[−9]: You get an emblem with "Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, that player loses the game."', '{1}, Sacrifice Goblin Cratermaker: Choose one —\n• Goblin Cratermaker deals 2 damage to target creature.\n• Destroy target colorless nonland permanent.', "{1}, Sacrifice another creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Undercity Necrolisk. It gains menace until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", '{1}{B}: Veiled Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "{1}{U}, {T}: Target creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.\n{2}{B}, {T}: Surveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)", '{2}{U}, {T}: You may cast an instant or sorcery spell from your hand without paying its mana cost.', "{2}{U}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{3}{U}, {T}: Draw a card.\n{X}{R}, {T}: Copy target instant or sorcery spell you control with mana value X. You may choose new targets for the copy.', '{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Silent Dart: It deals 3 damage to target creature.', "{4}{B}, {T}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain menace until end of turn. (They can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\n{1}{G}, {T}: You gain 2 life.", '{4}{G}: Devkarin Dissident gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{5}{R}, {T}: Legion Guildmage deals 3 damage to each opponent.\n{2}{W}, {T}: Tap another target creature.', '{G}, {T}: Creatures you control gain trample until end of turn.\n{5}{W}, {T}: Create a 2/2 green and white Elf Knight creature token with vigilance.', '{T}: Add {B} or {G}.\n{B/G}{B/G}{B/G}{B/G}, {T}, Sacrifice Golgari Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color. If that mana is spent on a multicolored creature spell, that creature enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.', '{T}: Add {G} or {W}.\n{G/W}{G/W}{G/W}{G/W}, {T}, Sacrifice Selesnya Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {R} or {W}.\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}, {T}, Sacrifice Boros Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {U} or {B}.\n{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}, {T}, Sacrifice Dimir Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {U} or {R}.\n{U/R}{U/R}{U/R}{U/R}, {T}, Sacrifice Izzet Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Mill a card.\n{2}, {T}, Exile Wand of Vertebrae: Shuffle up to five target cards from your graveyard into your library.']
